## Admin SPA bundle copied into @takuhon/cli at build time (regenerated from
## apps/admin/dist by scripts/copy-admin-bundle.mjs; shipped via the package's
## "files" allowlist, so it is published despite being git-ignored — like dist/).
/packages/cli/admin-bundle/

## Packaging (npm pack / publish dry-run tarballs)
*.tgz

