# ===== AI assistant / agent local state =====
# Per-contributor agent configuration, instruction files, and runtime caches.
# These are workstation-local — they should not ship to the published repo
# or to npm tarballs. Patterns cover the major editor agents and CLI
# assistants in current circulation.
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.local.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
GEMINI.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.cursorignore
.windsurf/
.windsurfrules
.aider*
.continue/
.codeium/
.zed/
.cline*
.clinerules*
.roo/
.roomodes*
.kilocode/
.tabnine/
.junie/
.agents/local/
.agents/tmp/

# ===== Local tooling state =====
# Sibling-project / workflow tooling that some contributors run alongside
# the takuhon checkout. The patterns are intentionally narrow (no `.basou/`
# wildcard) so any shared artefacts a contributor explicitly commits still
# go through.
.basou/logs/
.basou/raw/
.basou/tmp/
.basou/status.json
.basou/sessions/*/events.jsonl
.basou/sessions/*/artifacts/
.basou/approvals/pending/
.basou/approvals/resolved/
# basou: local-only tooling state -- never commit (supersedes any narrow .basou patterns above)
.basou/
